Dear all,

Using use.Rd2=TRUE in the roxygenize function does limit the Rd files
produced to functions and classes that have a roxygen preref. However,
this does not stop S4 methods without prerefs to be parsed and Rd
files to be generated.
Note that setting exportonly=TRUE in make.Rd2.roclet, does also
prevent Rd files to be generated for methods.

Does anyone have a quick fix for the former?

Thank you very much in advance.

Best wishes,

Laurent

